\"Brake Pad\\\", Bosch Filters \\\"Oil Filter\\\", Mann Filters \\\"Air Filter\\\" when the buyer calls GET /api/parts?category=Filters&brand=Bosch then The returned list contains only \\\"Oil Filter\\\"\",\n    \"Given The same parts when the buyer calls GET /api/parts?category=Filters&q=air then The returned list contains only \\\"Air Filter\\\"\",\n    \"Given The same parts when the buyer calls GET /api/parts?category=All&brand=All then The returned list contains all 3 parts\",\n    \"Given The same parts when the buyer calls GET /api/parts/brands then The returned list is [\\\"Bosch\\\", \\\"Mann\\\"], taken from the parts data\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"When the search text or a filter changes on Find parts, the portal shall show page 1 of the results.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given The buyer is on page 3 of Find parts when they change the category filter then Page 1 of the filtered results is shown\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"When no part matches the search and filters, the portal shall show \\\"No parts match\\\" and a button that clears the search and filters.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given No part contains the text \\\"zzzz\\\" when the buyer calls GET /api/parts?q=zzzz then The response status is 200 and the returned list is empty with total count 0\",\n    \"Given The buyer has searched \\\"zzzz\\\" with category Brakes on Find parts when the results load then \\\"No parts match\\\" is shown with a clear button, and pressing it empties the search box, sets both filters to All and shows page 1 of all parts\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"When the buyer presses \\\"Add to cart\\\" on a part that is in stock, the cart shall add a line with quantity 1, or raise the existing line's quantity by 1.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given An empty CartStore and a part with stock 10 when CartStore.addPart(part) is called then The returned lines list has one line for that part with quantity value 1\",\n    \"Given A CartStore holding 