tore holding 1 of a £12.50 part and 1 of a £5.00 part when CartStore.setQuantity(\\\"BP-200\\\", 4) is called for the £12.50 part then The returned lineTotal for that line is 50.00 and CartStore.subtotal() returns 55.00\",\n    \"Given The Cart screen with a line at quantity 1 when the buyer types 4 in the quantity field then The line total and the order total shown update without pressing any other button\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"If the buyer enters a quantity that is blank, 0, above 99 or not a whole number, then the cart shall set it to the nearest whole number from 1 to 99.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given A CartStore line for a part with stock 500 when CartStore.setQuantity is called with \\\"\\\", 0, 150 and 2.6 in turn then The returned quantity values are 1, 1, 99 and 3\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"If the buyer enters a quantity above the part's stock, then the cart shall set the quantity to the stock quantity and give the message \\\"Only n available\\\".\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given A CartStore line for a part with stock 4 when CartStore.setQuantity(partNumber, 7) is called then The returned quantity value is 4 and the returned message is \\\"Only 4 available\\\"\",\n    \"Given The Cart screen with a line for a part with stock 4 when the buyer types 7 in the quantity field then The field shows 4 and \\\"Only 4 available\\\" is displayed next to the line\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"When the buyer presses \\\"Remove\\\" on a cart line, the cart shall remove that line.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given A CartStore with lines BP-200 and OF-100 when CartStore.removeLine(\\\"BP-200\\\") is called then The returned lines list contains only OF-100 and CartStore.count() returns OF-100's quantity\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"The cart shall keep its lines in the browser's local storage under the signed-in buyer's ID, so the cart survives page reloads on the same device.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given A CartStore 