 37.50\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"When the buyer places an order with valid lines, address and delivery option, the orders API shall save an order with status Placed, a sequential order number ORD- followed by 6 zero-padded digits, each line's current part price as unit price, and total = subtotal + delivery charge.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given Buyer B1, no earlier orders in the database, part BP-200 at £12.50 with stock 10 when B1 calls POST /api/orders with lines [{partNumber: BP-200, quantity: 2}], address \\\"1 High St, Leeds\\\", deliveryOption NEXT_DAY then The response status is 201 and the response body has orderNumber \\\"ORD-000001\\\", status \\\"Placed\\\" and total 34.99\",\n    \"Given The order from AC-20.1 when the orders and order_lines tables are read then There is one orders row for buyer B1 with ORD-000001, date placed, address, deliveryOption NEXT_DAY, total 34.99, status Placed, and one order_lines row with partNumber BP-200, quantity 2, unitPrice 12.50\",\n    \"Given ORD-000001 exists when another valid order is placed then The returned orderNumber is \\\"ORD-000002\\\"\",\n    \"Given A client sends unitPrice 1.00 for BP-200 priced £12.50 when it calls POST /api/orders then The saved order_lines row has unitPrice 12.50, so the sent price value is ignored\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"ears\": \"If a place-order request has no lines, a quantity outside 1–99, an unknown part number, an address outside 5–200 characters, or a missing or unknown delivery option, then the orders API shall reject it with status 400 and save no order.\",\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    \"Given Buyer B1 when B1 calls POST /api/orders with an empty lines list and otherwise valid fields then The response status is 400 and the orders table row count is unchanged\",\n    \"Given Buyer B1 when B1 calls POST /api/orders with a 4-character address, then a 201-character address, then deliveryOption \\\"EXPRESS\\\", then quantity 0 then Each response status is 400 with 